          "Code relationships list the main imports, two dependents, and nearby tests.",
          "Recommended next step is to review token refresh tests before editing."
        ]
      },
      {
        "input": "Plan a refactor of a shared utility.",
        "output": "The skill returns a concise impact report with callers, importing modules, tests, and prior design notes. It highlights high-risk dependents first."
      },
      {
        "input": "Debug an error in a payment workflow.",
        "output": "The result connects the error keyword to earlier fixes, likely affected components, route handlers, and focused tests to inspect."
      }
    ],
    "best_practices": [
